{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月も残すところ10日になりましたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2017年になってはやくも1ヶ月が経とうとしている！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月はお正月休みとか成人式とかあったりで\nプライベートがすごく充実していた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい1月でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残りの10日はお仕事モードに完全切り替えて\nがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/01/21/0870285/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハートがいっぱい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/01/21/0870285/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまが私の頭の上にカイロを置くという\nイタズラを仕掛けてきて\nそれが温泉入ってるみたいだ！ってなって\n温泉にはいってる気分になってたところ\n伊織が撮ってくれた写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/01/21/0870285/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は幕張メッセで握手会ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにを着ようかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年に入ってまだお洋服買ってないから\nお買い物いきたいなーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントとお手紙受け取りました！\nいつも本当にありがとうございますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/01/21/0870285/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね！新しい小説買ったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ読み終えてなくて\nいま言っちゃうと皆さんのがはやく読んじゃって\nいろいろ言っちゃうと思うから\nまだ秘密です( ¯•ω•¯ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じっくり楽しんで読んでるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね！最近はゲームもやり始めようとしてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲーム買ったりしてるんだ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/01/21/0870285/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織が連写するから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/01/21/0870285/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不機嫌なふりしてみた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/01/21/0870285/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにか書きたいことがあったんだけど\n忘れちゃった。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、途中まで書いてたから\nこのまま更新します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また思い出したらかくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/01/21/0870285/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/01/21/0870285/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LBさんから頂いた\n名前入りのマグカップ愛用してるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/01/21/0870285/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあした！"}],"source":"archive"}